      "current": "2.1",
      "notes": "IR 2.0 changes gate/release, gain, mastering, randomness and repeat semantics. Migration preserves authored numeric intent, not old audio bytes. Review renders and regenerate manifests; docs/MIGRATION_3.md describes explicit compatibility choices. IR 2.1 raises master.stereo_width's ceiling from 1.0 to 2.0 (M/S widening; mid preserved, so the mono sum is unchanged); 2.0 specs migrate without audio review.",
      "policy": "structural-migration-audio-review-required",
